# Feature — Transfer Between Wallets

## Overview
Users can transfer balance from one wallet to another.
Transfer is NOT counted as income or expense — it only moves balance.
Transfer has its own history list separate from transactions.
Requires Multiple Wallets feature to be implemented first.

