## Screen Specifications

### transfer_sheet.dart — Bottom Sheet Modal
```
Triggered from:
- Home FAB long press → SpeedDial options: "Add Transaction" | "Transfer"
- Wallet Detail page → "Transfer ⇄" button

Layout (showModalBottomSheet, isScrollControlled: true):
- Handle bar at top (gray pill, centered)
- Title row: "Transfer" (bold 20px, left) | close icon (right)
- Divider

- FROM section:
  - Label: "From" (small gray uppercase)
  - WalletPickerTile: icon + name + balance (formatRupiah)
  - Tap → show wallet list bottom sheet

- Swap button: centered ⇄ icon button (tap to swap From/To wallets)

- TO section:
  - Label: "To" (small gray uppercase)
  - WalletPickerTile: icon + name + balance (formatRupiah)
  - Tap → show wallet list bottom sheet

- Amount section:
  - Large centered display: "Rp 0" (40px bold)
  - Tap → show custom numeric keypad (same as Add Transaction)

- Date row: Icons.calendar_today + formatted date → showDatePicker()
- Notes: TextField single line, hint "Add notes... (optional)"

- Transfer button: full-width black ElevatedButton "Transfer"

Validation (show inline error below field):
- fromWallet ≠ toWallet → "Please select different wallets"
- amount <= 0 → "Please enter an amount"
- fromWallet.balance < amount → "Insufficient balance in [wallet name]"

On success:
- Close bottom sheet
- Show SnackBar: "Transfer successful"
- Refresh wallet balances
```

### transfer_history_page.dart
```
- AppBar: large title "Transfer History", back button
- Accessed from Wallet Detail page → "Transfer History"
- SectionList grouped by date (same pattern as History page)
  - Section header: date label + daily transfer total
  - Each row: TransferItem widget
- Swipe to delete:
  - Show confirmation dialog: "Undo this transfer? Wallet balances will be reversed."
  - On confirm: call DeleteTransfer use case (reverses balances)
- Empty state: Icons.swap_horiz_outlined + "No transfers yet"
```

