## Design Rules
- Transfer icon: Icons.swap_horiz or ⇄ symbol
- Amount display: black (neutral — not income/expense)
- "Transfer" badge: gray pill (#E0E0E0 bg, #000000 text)
- Insufficient balance error: red-style BUT use dark gray (#3A3A3A) — no colors
- Swap button: gray circle background, black icon
- Success SnackBar: black background, white text
- All components: monochrome only, no colors

